          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutaleki likuva lidamanu kali lilala lituli mu minwa jinyu kali hakuzu mba, navuzwa muvoore makuva gaveeye malahi gukwumbaka gaduukanaa ni ing'inga yene yeyo, kandi gaduuki kuhaana zimbavasi kuyavo vagahulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutavereriza Roho Mutakatifu wa Nyasaye mba; kigira Roho aveeye muhuri gwa Nyasaye ku munyi, kugamanyia ndi lidiku lilakaduuki lia Nyasaye alakahaane vovoholore ku munyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muleke uvululu vwosi, nuvutima, nilivihilirwa; niliyoga, namanyego, vitulizwi mu munyi harara nembodoka yoosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muve novohooma aveene ku aveene; muve nu mwoyo gwi zimbavasi kandi musamiihane aveene naveene kuli Nyasaye yasamiha munyi mu Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
